{
  "slug": "rudder-core",
  "name": "Rudder Core",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-tool RudderStack domain knowledge: data catalog, data graphs, tracking plans, instrumentation planning, instrumentation debugging, and destination delivery debugging.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `rudder-code-first-instrumentation` (Derives tracking plans from existing codebase types and structures), `rudder-data-catalog` (Creates and manages events, properties, categories, and custom types for instrumentation schemas), `rudder-data-graphs` (Produces Data Graph YAML from RETL sources for Audiences), `rudder-design-first-instrumentation` (Plans instrumentation for new features starting from product requirements before code exists), `rudder-destination-debugging` (Diagnoses why events are failing, dropping, or not arriving at a destination), `rudder-environment-check` (Checks RudderStack tool prerequisites and reports status), `rudder-instrumentation-debugging` (Diagnoses and fixes validation errors, schema issues, and instrumentation problems), `rudder-instrumentation-planning` (Designs event taxonomies and instrumentation strategies from business requirements), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rudder-core@claude-community` from `rudderlabs/rudder-agent-skills` (`plugins/rudder-core`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
